lyMUkydi0tZERQV2puMjhVcXhKVWphVExhOHc5Zml2LWV1YUNGcHgxQWtiXzBSWFpiRGxfZjJmUWhJcTNCVDR2S1NwQUVRVVg3bC0yakhvMXhuLU1iWlRhVndiMHdHU0l6MkMxUmU1WHJnTEZSMWZVTW5TUjREeERsbG40QmdwaUo4Ql85bHZDa0NaQk9ES2VPUm9uZGo3RFZ4Ylc4elQtTThxNUVLODJVN3VR?oc=5","date":"2026-10-30","zh":"Kenvue 2026 年第三季：銷售額成長 3.2% 至 $3.89B，調整後每股盈餘 $0.29，金佰利交易無指引"},{"title":"Kimberly-Clark Corporation (KMB) Stock Price, News, Quote & History","src":"Yahoo! Finance Canada","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTFBzTngwV3E0MFU5VjBUcUlkMDd6ejl3LXA3c1BTVXJVaXlaMGgxamgzMDBOZTUzUUo3TVBBMXZYejRKXy1tNlVrOWhBeG80cVFE?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"金佰利公司 (KMB) 股票價格、新聞、報價和歷史"}],"themes":[{"name":"訂單/合約","count":6},{"name":"財報","count":4},{"name":"分析師評等","count":2}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-12","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/55785/000162828026007567/kmb-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Kimberly-Clark Corporation was founded in 1872 and incorporated in Delaware in 1928. We are a global company focused on delivering essential products and solutions that solve unmet consumer needs and provide Better Care for a Better World. We are principally engaged in the manufacturing and marketing of a wide range of products made from natural or synthetic fibers and materials using advanced technologies in fibers, nonwovens and absorbency. Kimberly-Clark and our trusted brands are an indispensable part of life for people in more than 175 countries and territories. Our portfolio of brands, including Huggies, Kleenex, Scott, Kotex, Cottonelle, Poise, Depend, Andrex, Pull-Ups, GoodNites, Intimus, Plenitud, Sweety, Softex, Viva and WypAll, hold No. 1 or No. 2 share positions in approximately 70 countries and encompass five global daily-need product categories: Baby & Child Care, Adult Car","zh":"金佰利公司成立於 1872 年，並於 1928 年在特拉華州註冊成立。我們是一家全球性公司，專注於提供基本產品和解決方案，解決未滿足的消費者需求，並為更美好的世界提供更好的照護。我們主要從事使用先進的纖維、不織布和吸收技術製造和行銷由天然或合成纖維和材料製成的各種產品。金佰利和我們值得信賴的品牌是超過 175 個國家和地區的人們生活中不可或缺的一部分。我們的品牌組合包括 Huggies、Kleenex、Scott、Kotex、Cottonelle、Poise、Depend、Andrex、Pull-Ups、GoodNites、Intimus、Plenitud、Sweety、Softex、Viva 和 WypAll，在約 70 個國家/地區佔據第五個或第二個的份額，涵蓋五個全球日常需求產品："},{"en":"On November 2, 2025, we entered into an Agreement and Plan of Merger (the \"Merger Agreement\") to acquire the outstanding equity interests of Kenvue, Inc. (\"Kenvue\"), a global consumer health leader, for stock and cash consideration (the \"Kenvue Acquisition\"). Under the terms of the Merger Agreement, which was unanimously approved by the Boards of Directors of each of Kimberly-Clark and Kenvue, each share of Kenvue common stock, par value $0.01 per share, issued and outstanding at the close of the Kenvue Acquisition (subject to certain provisions within the Merger Agreement) will be converted into the right to receive (i) 0.14625 shares of Kimberly-Clark common stock, par value $1.25 per share (the \"Stock Consideration\"), plus (ii) $3.50 in cash (the \"Cash Consideration\" and, together with the Stock Consideration, the \"Merger Consideration\"). In total, we expect approximately 280 million ","zh":"2025 年 11 月 2 日，我們簽訂了一項協議和合併計畫（「合併協議」），以股票和現金對價收購全球消費者健康領導者 Kenvue, Inc.（「Kenvue」）的已發行股權（「Kenvue 收購」）。根據經 Kimberly-Clark 和 Kenvue 各自董事會一致批准的合併協議條款，在 Kenvue 收購結束時發行並流通的每股 Kenvue 普通股（面值 0.01 美元）（須遵守合併協議中的某些條款）將轉換為接收 (i) 0.14625 股 Kimberly-Clark 普通股（面值）的每股 505 美元股股（面值），美元現金（“現金對價”，與股票對價一起統稱為“合併對價”）。總共，我們預計約 2.8 億"},{"en":"On June 5, 2025, we announced that the Company will form a joint venture with Suzano S.A. (\"Suzano\") and Suzano International Holding B.V., a wholly-owned subsidiary of Suzano (\"Buyer\"), comprised of substantially all the operations of the Company's former International Family Care and Professional (\"IFP\") segment (the \"IFP Business\"). To facilitate this transaction, we entered into an Equity and Asset Purchase Agreement (the \"Purchase Agreement\") with Buyer, pursuant to which we will, among other things, effectuate a reorganization through the transfer of certain assets, liabilities and equity interests of the IFP Business to Kimberly-Clark IFP NewCo B.V., an indirect wholly-owned subsidiary of the Company (the \"Joint Venture\"). At the time of closing, which is expected to take place in mid-2026 and will only take place following the satisfaction of consultation requirements and customa","zh":"2025 年 6 月 5 日，我們宣佈公司將與 Suzano S.A.（“Suzano”）和 Suzano International Holding B.V.（Suzano 的全資子公司（“買方”））組建一家合資企業，該合資企業由公司前國際家庭護理和專業（“IFP”）部門（“IFP 業務組成）。為了促進本次交易，我們與買方簽訂了股權和資產購買協議（「購買協議」），根據該協議，我們將透過將 IFP 業務的某些資產、負債和股權轉讓給公司的間接全資子公司 Kimberly-Clark IFP NewCo B.V.（「合資企業」）來實現重組。截至交割時，預計將於 2026 年中期進行，並且只有在滿足諮詢要求和客戶要求後才會進行"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Our largest customer, Walmart Inc., represented approximately 16% in 2025 and 2024 and 15% in 2023 of our net sales from continuing operations. Net sales to Walmart Inc. were primarily in the NA segment.","zh":"我們最大的客戶沃爾瑪公司在 2025 年和 2024 年約占我們持續經營業務淨銷售額的 16%，在 2023 年約占我們淨銷售額的 15%。沃爾瑪公司的淨銷售額主要來自北美市場。"}],"competition":[{"en":"We have several major competitors in most of our markets, some of which are larger and more diversified than us. The principal methods and elements of competition include brand recognition and loyalty, product innovation, quality and performance, price, and marketing and distribution capabilities. For additional discussion of the competitive environment in which we conduct our business, see Item 1A, \"Risk Factors.\"","zh":"我們在大多數市場都有幾個主要競爭對手，其中一些比我們規模更大、更多元化。競爭的主要方式和要素包括品牌認知度和忠誠度、產品創新、品質和性能、價格以及行銷和分銷能力。有關我們開展業務的競爭環境的更多討論，請參閱第 1A 項「風險因素」。"},{"en":"We are a purpose-led company with purposeful brands. Our longstanding focus on sustainability and our commitment to provide Better Care for a Better World comes to life through four interconnected pillars: Better Products, Better Planet, Better Workplace and Better Society.","zh":"我們是一家以目標為導向的公司，擁有目標明確的品牌。我們對永續發展的長期關注以及為更美好的世界提供更好的關懷的承諾透過四個相互關聯的支柱得以實現：更好的產品、更好的地球、更好的工作場所和更好的社會。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"North America NA","val":10753000000,"zh":"北美 不適用"},{"name":"International Personal Care IPC","val":5694000000,"zh":"國際個人護理IPC"}],"total":16447000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Babyandchildcareproducts","val":6773000000,"zh":"嬰幼兒照護產品"},{"name":"Family Care","val":4056000000,"zh":"居家護理"},{"name":"Adult Care Products","val":1947000000,"zh":"成人護理產品"},{"name":"Professional","val":1841000000,"zh":"專業的"},{"name":"Feminine Care Products","val":1706000000,"zh":"女性護理產品"},{"name":"All Other","val":124000000,"zh":"所有其他"}],"total":16447000000}},"peers":["CLX","CL","GIS","PEP","EMR"]}}